## A Personal Note from the Developer

CreatorStudio was developed as an educational project to solve a problem I personally experienced while organizing content ideas, video projects, editing tasks, and publishing schedules.

I built this application as a practical solution to make content management easier and more organized.

You are welcome to explore, use, learn from, and modify this project for your own purposes.

If you find this project useful and decide to use or build upon it, I would genuinely appreciate a little kindness:

- Please give proper credit to the original project.
- If you use or modify this project, I would appreciate it if you let me know.
- Feel free to share your improvements or ideas.

There is no obligation to contact me or ask for permission under the MIT License. This is simply a friendly request from the developer.

Thank you for respecting the time and effort behind this project.

**Built with curiosity, learning, and a real-world problem in mind.**
